{"status":"ready","content":"I need to multiply these two large numbers exactly.\n\nLet me break this down systematically:\n\n123456789123456789 × 987654321987654321\n\nI notice both numbers have a repeating pattern:\n- 123456789123456789 = 123456789 × 10^9 + 123456789\n- 987654321987654321 = 987654321 × 10^9 + 987654321\n\nSo if I let:\n- a = 123456789\n- b = 987654321\n\nThen I'm computing:\n(a × 10^9 + a) × (b × 10^9 + b) = (a(10^9 + 1)) × (b(10^9 + 1))\n= ab(10^9 + 1)^2\n\nFirst, let me find ab:\n123456789 × 987654321 = 121932631112635269\n\nNext, (10^9 + 1)^2:\n(10^9 + 1)^2 = 10^18 + 2×10^9 + 1 = 1000000002000000001\n\nNow multiply:\n121932631112635269 × 1000000002000000001\n\n= 121932631112635269 × 10^18 + 121932631112635269 × 2 × 10^9 + 121932631112635269\n\n= 121932631112635269000000000000000000 \n  + 243865262225270538000000000\n  + 121932631112635269\n\n= **121932631112635269243865262225270538121932631112635269**\n","metadata":{"modelLabel":"Claude Haiku 4.5","modelId":"anthropic/claude-haiku-4.5","promptId":"33-own-Huge-Multiplication","content":"I need to multiply these two large numbers exactly.\n\nLet me break this down systematically:\n\n123456789123456789 × 987654321987654321\n\nI notice both numbers have a repeating pattern:\n- 123456789123456789 = 123456789 × 10^9 + 123456789\n- 987654321987654321 = 987654321 × 10^9 + 987654321\n\nSo if I let:\n- a = 123456789\n- b = 987654321\n\nThen I'm computing:\n(a × 10^9 + a) × (b × 10^9 + b) = (a(10^9 + 1)) × (b(10^9 + 1))\n= ab(10^9 + 1)^2\n\nFirst, let me find ab:\n123456789 × 987654321 = 121932631112635269\n\nNext, (10^9 + 1)^2:\n(10^9 + 1)^2 = 10^18 + 2×10^9 + 1 = 1000000002000000001\n\nNow multiply:\n121932631112635269 × 1000000002000000001\n\n= 121932631112635269 × 10^18 + 121932631112635269 × 2 × 10^9 + 121932631112635269\n\n= 121932631112635269000000000000000000 \n  + 243865262225270538000000000\n  + 121932631112635269\n\n= **121932631112635269243865262225270538121932631112635269**\n","inferredMetada